msgstr "Aucun menu"

#: admin/views/settings.php:387
msgid "This site has no Navigation menu yet."
msgstr "Ce site n’a pas encore de menu Navigation."

#: admin/views/settings.php:394
msgid ""
"For classic themes: the menu shown in each location, per language. Leave "
"empty to keep the menu set in Appearance > Menus."
msgstr ""
"Pour les thèmes classiques : le menu affiché à chaque emplacement, par "
"langue. Laissez vide pour garder le menu défini dans Apparence > Menus."

#: admin/views/settings.php:403
msgid "Location"
msgstr "Emplacement"

#: admin/views/settings.php:429
msgid ""
"The active theme registers no classic menu location: menus are handled by "
"Navigation blocks above."
msgstr ""
"Le thème actif ne déclare aucun emplacement de menu classique : les menus "
"passent par les blocs Navigation ci-dessus."

#: admin/views/settings.php:456
msgid "Form translations"
msgstr "Traductions des formulaires"

#: admin/views/settings.php:458
msgid ""
"Link the versions of a form: wherever one of them is inserted, visitors see "
